  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "You know all those friends that have been offline for months, if not years? Great! You know how VRChat can email you that \"We Miss You\" email, nudging you to get back in? Well what if you could send something similar through a user's profile (on the website) who has been offline for a significant amount of time, to send a one-time notification email through VRChat telling them that a specific user misses them! Huge cooldown, no custom message, just a \"knock\".\n\nLimitations beyond just a cooldown are also of course applicable.\n\nThe in-game knock feature wasn't quite popular, but it had good intentions.\n\nI thought of this initially since I was reminded of the Callback Campaign that exists for FFXIV.",
